---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing — Free forever, Pro when you need it | Main Street Toolbox"
  description="Every calculator on Main Street Toolbox is free, forever, with no signup. Pro keeps your work: unlimited saved results, client files and clean printable reports."
  path="/pricing/"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom:16px">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Simple pricing</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:var(--fs-800);margin:12px 0 8px">Every calculator is <em style="color:var(--green)">free forever</em>.<br/>Pro just helps you keep your work.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:8px">
    <div class="container" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px;max-width:52rem">
      <div class="card card-pad">
        <div class="result-lbl">Free</div>
        <div class="result-num" style="font-size:2.4rem">$0</div>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-2);margin:8px 0 16px">For anyone who needs a number right now.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 4px 18px;display:grid;gap:6px">
          <li>Every tool, unlimited use</li>
          <li>No signup, no ads, no catch</li>
          <li>Print & share any result</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-pad" style="border-top:4px solid var(--green)">
        <div class="result-lbl">Pro — coming soon</div>
        <div class="result-num" style="font-size:2.4rem">$9<span style="font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink-3)">/mo</span></div>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-2);margin:8px 0 16px">For owners who run the same numbers every week.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 4px 18px;display:grid;gap:6px">
          <li>Unlimited saved results, in the cloud</li>
          <li>Client files & quote history</li>
          <li>Printable reports with your own name, no watermark</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--ink-3);font-size:var(--fs-400);margin-top:12px">In the works — Pro launches with the account system. Until then, everything is free.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container explain" style="padding-top:0">
    <h2>Need the whole thing built for you?</h2>
    <p>Concierge setup: send us your purchase records and menu, and we build your complete cost chain for you —
    <a href="/services">$99 founding price, five slots a month</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
